       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-SPAT-ANCHOR.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SPAT-ANCHOR-PROOFS.
           05  WS-MERKLE-COORD-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PROJECTION-SOUND-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RIGID-TRANSFORM-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SPATIAL-LATENCY-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SPAT-ANCHOR-SEAL-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-SPAT-ANCHOR-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-SPAT-PROVEN          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-SPAT-CODE          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-MERKLE-AND-PROJECTION.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-RIGID-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-SPAT-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-MERKLE-AND-PROJECTION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MERKLE-COORD-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PROJECTION-SOUND-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-RIGID-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RIGID-TRANSFORM-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SPATIAL-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-SPAT-PROOFS.
           IF WS-MERKLE-COORD-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PROJECTION-SOUND-OK = 1 AND
              WS-RIGID-TRANSFORM-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SPATIAL-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-SPAT-ANCHOR-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-SPAT-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-SPAT-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-SPAT-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-SPAT-CODE.
